  m_Name: Merchant Montague
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Merchant Montague
  offerText: I have procured a crate of highly experimental herbal tea. Pay the rather
    steep import tax today, and a brewed cup later will ensure your physical constitution
    remains absolutely impenetrable.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the funds and secure the exotic leaves. You prepare
    a pot, hoping for the best.
  rejectResultText: You dismiss the merchant, preferring to trust your own natural
    immune system and keeping your wallet heavy.
  acceptedDelayedText: Montague's tea takes full effect. A rush of pure vitality
    flushes through your veins, entirely curing your fatigue!
  rejectedDelayedText: A sudden and vicious flu sweeps through the building. Without
    Montague's tea to protect you, you fall terribly ill.
